# Derived by hand from Type System ch. 2 ("Bundles and sparse tuples") and Semantics ch. 8 ("The patch": an answer is an `Edge`, only the event components that fired; a response is addressed by path): each answer fires the parts it holds, in the tick it comes in.
test two_events

tick 0
  added:
    0: Pad.Line(address="chat:7000")
    1: Ui.Label(text="none, 0 lost")

tick 1
  in:
    0: (("hello", -))
  changed:
    1: Ui.Label(text="hello, 0 lost")

tick 2
  in:
    0: ((-, 3))
  changed:
    1: Ui.Label(text="hello, 3 lost")

tick 3
  in:
    0: (("bye", 2))
  changed:
    1: Ui.Label(text="bye, 5 lost")
